{"id":"n70709-1-10","stage":2,"title":"감동 · 感动","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70709-1-10-1","ko":"연극 어땠어?","zh":"那部话剧怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"연극","meaning":"话剧，戏剧","explanation":"연극：话剧，戏剧","readings":[{"term":"연극","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13977","senseId":"1","lemma":"연극","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ca8deda3ff79221b","term":"연극","zh":"话剧，戏剧","audio":"/audio/ca8deda3ff79221b26a4.mp3","entryId":"13977","definition":"演员在舞台上照着剧本向观众展示演技的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː극"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c5aca83393f4e3d9a276.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70709-1-10-2","ko":"배우들 연기에 감동을 받고 눈물을 얼마나 흘렸는지 몰라.","zh":"演员们的表演太打动了，我不知流了多少眼泪。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배우들","meaning":"演员","explanation":"배우：演员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"배우","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58204","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연기에","meaning":"演技","explanation":"연기：演技；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"연기","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67479","senseId":"1","lemma":"연기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감동을","meaning":"感动，打动","explanation":"감동：感动，打动；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"감동","audio":"/audio/2a1ffce0bf4b418393ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70709","senseId":"1","lemma":"감동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받고","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈물을","meaning":"眼泪，泪水","explanation":"눈물：眼泪，泪水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"눈물","audio":"/audio/591f11d8b2394fcfd2e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55290","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多么","explanation":"얼마나：多么","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흘렸는지","meaning":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","explanation":"흘리다：流出来，流淌，淌出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"흘리다","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91709","senseId":"5","lemma":"흘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰라.","meaning":"不知道","explanation":"모르다：不知道；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"6","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"70129359d515b770","term":"배우","zh":"演员","audio":"/audio/70129359d515b77048d9.mp3","entryId":"58204","definition":"担任电影、话剧或电视剧等中的人物角色进行表演的人。","pronunciation":["배우"]},{"id":"8b0e2bb594ceb0c3","term":"연기","zh":"演技","audio":"/audio/8b0e2bb594ceb0c31f20.mp3","entryId":"67479","definition":"演员根据扮演的角色表现人物、性格、行动等的行为。","pronunciation":["연ː기"]},{"id":"2a1ffce0bf4b4183","term":"감동","zh":"感动，打动","audio":"/audio/2a1ffce0bf4b418393ca.mp3","entryId":"70709","definition":"有强烈感受后心动。","pronunciation":["감ː동"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到他人行为、心理作用等的影响。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"591f11d8b2394fcf","term":"눈물","zh":"眼泪，泪水","audio":"/audio/591f11d8b2394fcfd2e6.mp3","entryId":"55290","definition":"从人或动物的眼里流出来的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["눈물"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多么","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"状态或感觉等的程度非常大而厉害地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"a98bf9ca76ba3927","term":"흘리다","zh":"流出来，流淌，淌出来","audio":"/audio/a98bf9ca76ba39279166.mp3","entryId":"91709","definition":"汗液、眼泪、鼻涕、血、口水等液体从体内排出。","pronunciation":["흘리다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"很了不起，简直无以言表。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2e0436ec1de0615225d4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70709","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":71,"sequenceScore":1.9134,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["演员们的表演太打动了，我不知流了多少眼泪。","亲爱的！你今天什么时候回来？","那部话剧怎么样？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["演员们的表演太打动了，我不知流了多少眼泪。","那部话剧怎么样？","亲爱的！你今天什么时候回来？"],"answer":0}]}
